#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_1F/scripts.inc:19
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_1F_Text_Grunt1Intro"
msgid ""
"When TEAM MAGMA has roll call, we get\n"
"important guarding assignments in\l"
"the order that we line up.\p"
"That's why I'm stuck off in this corner.\n"
"I'm always late to roll call!$"
msgstr ""
"熔岩队点名的时候，会按照排队的\n"
"顺序分配重要的看守任务。\p"
"所以我才会被扔在这个角落里。\n"
"我每次点名都迟到！$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_1F/scripts.inc:26
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_1F_Text_Grunt1Defeat"
msgid ""
"I'm always late for training sessions,\n"
"too!\p"
"I hate to say it, but I'm wimpy…$"
msgstr ""
"我训练的时候也总是迟到！\p"
"虽然不想承认，但我真的很弱……$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_1F/scripts.inc:31
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_1F_Text_Grunt1PostBattle"
msgid ""
"Okay, I'll try to put a little more\n"
"effort into things from now on…$"
msgstr ""
"好吧，从现在起，\n"
"我做事会稍微努力一点的……$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_1F/scripts.inc:35
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_1F_Text_Grunt2Intro"
msgid ""
"Our leader told us to dig into\n"
"MT. CHIMNEY, so we dug and dug.\p"
"And in the course of digging, we came\n"
"across something that blew our minds!\p"
"What did we find?\p"
"Fuhahaha!\n"
"I'll tell you if you beat me!$"
msgstr ""
"首领叫我们挖开烟囱山，我们就挖啊挖。\p"
"结果在挖的过程中，\n"
"我们发现了一样让人大吃一惊的东西！\p"
"我们发现了什么呢？\p"
"呼哈哈哈！打赢我的话就告诉你！$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_1F/scripts.inc:44
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_1F_Text_Grunt2Defeat"
msgid ""
"Arrgh!\n"
"Taken down!$"
msgstr "啊啊！被打倒了！$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_1F/scripts.inc:48
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_1F_Text_Grunt2PostBattle"
msgid ""
"I won't tell you after all.\n"
"You'll find out when you get there!\p"
"It'd be better if you saved surprises\n"
"to the end, don't you think?$"
msgstr ""
"我还是不告诉你了。\n"
"等你到了那里就知道了！\p"
"惊喜还是留到最后比较好，你说是不是？$"
